<title>USA: Northland Cranberries Inc Q4 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Northland Cranberries Inc Q4 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>WISCONSIN RAPIDS, Wis. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	 loss	   $0.05     loss	 $0.19</p>
<p> Net	 loss	     669     loss	 1,868</p>
<p> Revs			 5,246			124</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,994		    9,701</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)  </p>
<p>		     YEAR</p>
<p> Shr	profit	  $0.50   profit	 $0.18</p>
<p> Net	profit	  6,905   profit	 1,582</p>
<p> Revs			37,608		   21,784</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,928		    8,891</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q4 ended August 31 in both years.</p>
<p>In June 1995 Northland changed its fiscal year end from March 31 to August 31 to correspond with a new busines cycle. As a result, 12-month periods are fiscal year 1996 of September 1, 1995, through August 31, 1996, and fiscal year 1995 of April 1, 1994, through March 31, 1995.</p>
<p>Net income per share reflects a two-for-one stock split for class A common shares.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
